    turnFlow: '1. Deal layout: 8 tableau depots (1 card each), 6 reserve piles (4 cards each), stock = remainder. 2. Play phase: Move exposed top cards from reserve or tableau to foundations (4 A-up, 4 K-down in suit) or build on tableau in ascending/descending suit (wrap King-Ace). Vacant depots accept any exposed card. Reserve piles cannot be built on. 3. Redeal: When no moves, deal 2 more cards to each reserve; repeat until 8 cards left, then 1 per depot. 4. Win when all 104 cards are on foundations.',
